    "QuasiFeffermanB.REAL_SCALAR_DUHAMEL": {
      "type": "@QuasiFeffermanB.REAL_SCALAR_DUHAMEL : \u2200 {E : Type u_1} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : NormedSpace \u211d E]\n  [CompleteSpace E] (\u03b1 T : \u211d) (u f : \u211d \u2192 E),\n  0 \u2264 T \u2192\n    ContinuousOn u (Set.Icc 0 T) \u2192\n      ContinuousOn f (Set.Icc 0 T) \u2192\n        (\u2200 t \u2208 Set.Ioo 0 T, HasDerivAt u (f t - \u03b1 \u2022 u t) t) \u2192\n          u T = Real.exp (-\u03b1 * T) \u2022 u 0 + \u222b (s : \u211d) in 0..T, Real.exp (-\u03b1 * (T - s)) \u2022 f s",
