    "QuasiFeffermanB.COEFFICIENT_TRANSPORT_SHARP_EUCLIDEAN": {
      "type": "QuasiFeffermanB.COEFFICIENT_TRANSPORT_SHARP_EUCLIDEAN : \u2200 (N : \u2115) (c : SingularClosure.FourierCoeff),\n  (\u2200 p \u2209 SingularClosure.cutoffModes N, \u2200 (i : Fin 3), c p i = 0) \u2192\n    SingularClosure.SpectralSolenoidal c \u2192\n      \u2200 (k : SingularClosure.Frequency),\n        k \u2260 0 \u2192\n          QuasiFeffermanB.complexVecNorm\n              (SingularClosure.coefficientLeray k (SingularClosure.coefficientTransport N c k)) \u2264\n            SingularClosure.criticalFrequencyWeight k / 2 *\n              \u2211 p \u2208 SingularClosure.cutoffModes N,\n                QuasiFeffermanB.complexVecNorm (c p) * QuasiFeffermanB.complexVecNorm (c (k - p))",
