      "type": "@QuasiFeffermanB.GALERKIN_CHI0_BUDGET_OF_SHARP_MULTIPLIER_AND_HEAT : \u2200 {\u03bd : \u211d} {a : SingularClosure.Field} {N : \u2115}\n  (g : SingularClosure.GalerkinSolution \u03bd a N),\n  0 < \u03bd \u2192\n    \u2200 (H : \u211d),\n      0 \u2264 H \u2192\n        4 * (1 / (2 * \u221a(2 * \u03bd))) * H < 1 \u2192\n          (\u2200 k \u2208 SingularClosure.cutoffModes N,\n              \u2200 (t : \u211d),\n                0 \u2264 t \u2192\n                  QuasiFeffermanB.complexVecNorm\n                      (SingularClosure.coefficientLeray k (SingularClosure.coefficientTransport N (g.coeff t) k)) \u2264\n                    SingularClosure.criticalFrequencyWeight k / 2 *\n                      QuasiFeffermanB.finiteModeConvolution N (g.coeff t) k) \u2192\n            (\u2200 (T : \u211d),\n                0 \u2264 T \u2192\n                  QuasiFeffermanB.finiteTimeL2 T\n                      (QuasiFeffermanB.finiteHeatSum (SingularClosure.cutoffModes N)\n                        SingularClosure.criticalFrequencyWeight (fun k => QuasiFeffermanB.complexVecNorm (g.coeff 0 k))\n                        \u03bd) \u2264\n                    H) \u2192\n              \u2200 (T : \u211d),\n                0 \u2264 T \u2192\n                  \u222b (t : \u211d) in 0..T, QuasiFeffermanB.finiteChi0 (SingularClosure.cutoffModes N) (g.coeff t) ^ 2 \u2264\n                    4 * H ^ 2",
