                       \u222b (r : \u211d) in s..t,\n                                  SingularClosure.criticalGradientEnergy (QuasiFeffermanB.energyGlobalGradient U r) \u2264\n                            SingularClosure.physicalEnergy (QuasiFeffermanB.energyPeriodicVelocity U s)",
